                <td class="text-right font-bold">Rp 1.250.000,-</td>
                <td>Dedicated IP, Unlimited Bandwidth, RAM 4GB+, Proteksi DDoS & Uptime 99.9%</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="font-bold">Paket Pemeliharaan & Backup Cloud</td>
