    <h3>5. SKEMA & TAHAPAN PEMBAYARAN (PAYMENT TERMS)</h3>
    <table class="data-table">
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 25%;">Termin Pembayaran</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;" class="text-center">Persentase</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;" class="text-right">Nominal (IDR)</th>
            <th style="width: 40%;">Kondisi Penagihan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="font-bold">Termin 1 (Uang Muka / DP)</td>
            <td class="text-center font-bold">40%</td>
            <td class="text-right font-bold">Rp 8.000.000,-</td>
            <td>Saat penandatanganan kesepakatan kerjasama, setup VPS & domain.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="font-bold">Termin 2 (UAT & Deploy)</td>
